## Verification Plan

### Automated Replay Benchmarks
- We will execute the `dpcr-ids-benchmark-fusion` tool natively on the Pi continuously to plot a memory and CPU heatmap.
- Test routing ratios to ensure fallback thresholds trigger correctly upon injection of out-of-distribution (OOD) data.

### HIL Live Capture Verification
- Deploy `canplayer` dumping to `vcan0`, while logging from the IDS bridge script to ensure true capture-to-insight end-to-end latency falls within the `bucket_ms` routing deadline (e.g., 250ms).
